      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Step into the newly renovated University of Alberta Botanic Garden (formerly Devonian Garden) for an evening of hors d’oeuvres, wine, and charming performances on four stages! This event sells out every year, so purchase your tickets in advance!"
      }
