      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Our new production of&nbsp; La Traviata &nbsp;combines spectacle, passion, drama, and thrilling music to tell the story of Violetta, a famous Parisian courtesan who is consumed both by love and a life-threatening illness. Don't miss the opera that inspired the blockbuster film&nbsp; Moul"
      }
