      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Before Edmonton Opera's upcoming production of HMS Pinafore sets sail, we need your help to fill this ship with lots of goods for our friends at  Edmonton's Food Bank ! Bring a non-perishable food item and join us at Southgate (Centre Court, near the GAP store) for a special performance by soprano V"
