      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Immerse yourself in the celestial wonders of  Aquarius,  a breathtaking fusion of opera’s greatest moments inspired by the skies and galaxies. Presented at the Zeidler Dome, in partnership with the Telus World of Science, this unique event promises an unforgettable evening where opera meets the cosm"
