    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "What began in Dianne Kipnes’ own living room many years ago has grown into one of Edmonton’s most meaningful and exclusive celebrations. This February, Edmonton Opera proudly presents the newly named  Dianne Kipnes Valentine’s Gala  — continuing her legacy of artistry, philanthropy, and community."
      }
