      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Embark on the next chapter of Wagner’s monumental Ring Cycle with  Die Walküre  continuing the saga introduced in Das Rheingold. This new production, arranged by Jonathan Dove, pushes the boundaries of opera, reaching new heights of operatic innovation in Edmonton. &nbsp;  In partnership with th"
