      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "In February, we present a profoundly moving production of  Bluebeard’s Castle , where love takes centre stage. Originating from the Theatre of Sound in London, UK, this contemporary production tells a love story shadowed by dementia.  Each door Judith opens is a step into her past, exploring her mem"
      }
