      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join the artists of La Bohème as they discuss Puccini’s masterpiece, and the unique challenges of creating grand opera during a pandemic. Artists include: Lara Cikiewicz (Musetta), Peter Barrett (Marcello), and Luka Kawabata (Schaunard). Streaming free on Facebook and YouTube."
      }
