      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Follow the lives of struggling young artists as they search for connection and meaning in 19th century Paris. Seamlessly blending comedy and tragedy, Puccini’s masterpiece continues to inspire audiences with some of the most beautiful music ever written."
      }
