      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Starring soprano Xin Wang and percussionist Ryan Scott,  Grover and Friends  and  Alarm  are two scenes based on composer Vivian Fung’s family oral history that she gathered during the spring of 2021.   Streaming on Edmonton Opera’s Facebook page, YouTube channel, and FavaTV’s Studio 19."
      }
