      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A micro-adaptation of Thomas King’s recent  Indians on Vacation , the novel chronicles the Prague vacation of a contemporary Indigenous couple. The short opera uses three scenes to create a musical portrait of the protagonist, Bird, as he confronts his inner demons.   Streaming on Edmonton Opera’s F"
      }
