        "@value": "Looking to get creative with your kids this summer? We’re bringing you four fun-filled activities that explore Mozart’s The Magic Flute and the different art forms that come together in opera!\n\nSummer Opera Camp is designed for children ages 8–12 or anyone who’s curious to learn more about opera!"
      }
    ],
