        "@value": "Join us on Facebook for the digital premiere of “Listening For What Comes Next” — a new song commissioned by Edmonton Opera with  generous support from the Edmonton Arts Council. With music by composer Jennifer McMillan and words by poet Lisa Martin, this new piece explores longing, connection, and"
