        "@value": "On September 19, Edmonton Opera offered free drive-in concerts to celebrate Alberta Culture Days! With over 800 entries, only 70 lucky vehicles were able to attend each performance — but now you're able to experience the concert live from the comfort of your own home (or car)!"
      }
