        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Celebrate Alberta Culture Days with a virtual sensory experience designed for toddlers 6 months–3 years.  Mezzo-soprano  Catherine Daniel  and pianist  Leanne Regehr  will take toddlers and their parents/guardians on a virtual safari to meet the adorable critters of French composer  Camille Saint-Sa"
