        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "In the Age of Enlightenment, an optimistic simpleton and his band of misfits travel the world in search of happiness, only to find chaos and trouble around every corner! Based on Voltaire’s celebrated novel,  Candide  is a delightful satire that features hit tunes like “Glitter and be gay” and “Make"
