        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Please join us for a special master class at JDIC Seniors’ Centre with Dr. Laurier Fagnan.  Sharpen your performance skills during our free series of master classes! All singing abilities welcome.   Limited spots for students and spectators available.  Please RSVP to  carissa.fedoruk@edmontonopera.c"
