        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Please join us for a special master class at Concordia University!  Watch as Krista de Silva  (Rigoletto, Candide ) and Kim Cousineau work with students from Concordia.  Spectators welcome! Registration is required due to limited spots available.   Please RSVP to  carissa.fedoruk@edmontonopera.com ."
