        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Enjoy a light dinner, glass of wine and a special recital of Italian opera favourites!  Featuring Edmonton Opera artists Andrea Lett (Gilda understudy), Jonathan Kirby (Rigoletto understudy) and Dr. Leanne Regehr (accompanist).   Program  Doors open at 5:30pm Light dinner served at 6pm Recital at 7p"
