        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "In partnership with UofA’s Métis Settlement Life Skills Journey Program, we present music by Darlene Auger, Prince Charles School, and soprano Ana Toumine. Join us in the spirit of hope and reconciliation, in recognition of Orange Shirt Day."
