      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Based on the Brothers Grimm fairy tale,  Hansel &amp; Gretel  takes you deep into the forbidden forest with a charmingly curious brother-sister duo. This German classic features Engelbert Humperdinck’s sumptuous score and richly woven characters that will enchant audiences of all ages.   Our del"
