        "@value": "From the composer of&nbsp; The Barber of Seville&nbsp; comes another raucous comedy with gorgeous bel canto melodies and vocal fireworks galore! Come along for the ride as a love triangle unfolds between Count Ory, his cunning Page, and a feisty Countess."
      }
