      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "As part of our Vocal Masterclass series, we welcome acclaimed mezzo-soprano Catherine Daniel, who was last seen in the role of Klytämnestra in  Elektra . A group of emerging artists from the Edmonton community will perform one by one, followed by informative insights on vocal technique from Ms. Dani"
