    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Tickets from $55!  Edmonton Opera presents a delightful new production of Gilbert &amp; Sullivan's classic operetta reimagined in the extravagant 1920s Jazz Age. With jazzy new musical arrangements and foot tapping choreography, you are invited for an evening of spectacular entertainment aboard"
